    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like everything i thought was real just... evaporated. like the floor just fell out from under me. i spent my whole life building everything on these beliefs, and now i realize it was all just a lie. i don't even recognize myself anymore. what's even the point of trying to keep building when there's nothing solid to build on?",
